        <mxCell id="c114" value="# 最小可实现：先只算检索命中&lt;br&gt;hits = [any(ref in d.metadata[&#x27;id&#x27;] for d in vs.similarity_search(q, k=5))&lt;br&gt;        for q, ref in gold]&lt;br&gt;hit_at_5 = sum(hits) / len(hits)" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#fbfbf9;strokeColor=#1f3864;fontSize=8;fontColor=#1a1a1a;arcSize=8;spacing=6;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
